### module_function def trace_object_allocations { ... }

与えられたブロック内でオブジェクトのトレースを行います。　

```ruby title="例"
require 'objspace'

class C
  include ObjectSpace

  def foo
    trace_object_allocations do
      obj = Object.new
      p "#{allocation_sourcefile(obj)}:#{allocation_sourceline(obj)}"
    end
  end
end

p C.new.foo # => "objtrace.rb:8"
```

